I live right outside of Keith Hills.

00:05:49.954 --> 00:05:53.684
So I think I ended up kind
of playing with him first.

00:05:53.684 --> 00:05:54.716
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:54.716 --> 00:05:57.330
But I just remember my
impression of this guy,

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.190
first of all, you, I've
talked about this before,

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:03.130
but unlike you at that
age, I was very much like,

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.681
I'd meet you and then that night,

00:06:05.681 --> 00:06:08.450
I ask if I can spend
