never do that, but as a kid,

00:06:13.975 --> 00:06:16.950
I got to know people and
immediately invited myself.

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:18.463
I was like, "So can I spend
the night your house?"

00:06:18.463 --> 00:06:20.597
It was pretty indiscriminatory.

00:06:20.597 --> 00:06:24.670
Yeah, and so that was what I did with Ben

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:27.347
and I think as a new kid
in town, he was like,

00:06:27.347 --> 00:06:28.876
"Yeah, I got a friend."

00:06:28.876 --> 00:06:32.480
And I just found this guy and his family

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:33.880
