00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:36.576
You know, they were from Oklahoma,

00:06:36.576 --> 00:06:38.138
they had moved from Oklahoma,

00:06:38.138 --> 00:06:40.517
and the way Ben talked about Oklahoma,

00:06:40.517 --> 00:06:45.517
made me think the Oklahoma
was a magical place.

00:06:45.872 --> 00:06:47.483
Land of milk and honey?

00:06:47.483 --> 00:06:50.078
He talked about giant catfish
that could eat children.

00:06:50.078 --> 00:06:53.644
And then he would talk he
