00:10:06.829 --> 00:10:09.404
If you find a good spot you
can walk across on some rocks

00:10:09.404 --> 00:10:10.330
without getting wet.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.494
Maybe a couple of feet
deep at the deepest point.

00:10:12.494 --> 00:10:14.347
But if you find one of
those places that like

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:16.811
a log is already kind of across the creek

00:10:16.811 --> 00:10:18.600
and there's some rocks, you're like,

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.097
oh, I can add a little bit to this

00:10:20.097 --> 00:10:22.055
