and build our own dam.

00:10:22.055 --> 00:10:24.623
It's just, you know,

00:10:24.623 --> 00:10:27.123
my kids don't know what to do today.

00:10:27.123 --> 00:10:27.956
You know.

00:10:27.956 --> 00:10:30.425
They're not damming a
creek, I'll tell you that.

