Three teens dam creek.

00:10:38.514 --> 00:10:42.424
We spent like sun up to sun
sundown in this endeavor.

00:10:42.424 --> 00:10:44.727
And we we dammed the creek.

00:10:44.727 --> 00:10:45.560
Yep.

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:47.076
For like a few minutes.

00:10:47.076 --> 00:10:48.855
No.

