You know what I'm saying?

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.770
I want as much as I want
to be a beaver sometimes,

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:15.391
I'm not a beaver, and I don't
understand the dam math,

00:11:15.391 --> 00:11:17.975
