00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:24.650
But there was a time in
which we would we dammed it,

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:25.830
went down to the creek,

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.438
caught some like crappie,

00:11:27.438 --> 00:11:28.649
we would catch all kinds of crappie.

00:11:28.649 --> 00:11:29.482
Yeah.

00:11:29.482 --> 00:11:30.315
Down there.

00:11:30.315 --> 00:11:31.470
He fished a lot.

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:35.260
There were a lot of I mean,
the, the creek emptied into

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:37.383
a series of ponds that--

00:11:37.383 --> 00:11:40.214
Basically man made ponds
for the golf course

00:11:40.214 --> 00:11:41.860
